   "y": 3424,
   "w": 560,
   "z": 1,
   "rot": 0,
   "type": "text",
   "text": {
    "text": "On a bien souvent répété que la Géométrie est l’art de bien raisonner sur des figures mal faites.\n(It has very often been repeated that geometry is the art of reasoning well about badly drawn figures.)",
    "font": "Times New Roman",
    "size": 20,
